  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_{OAB}=\\frac{1}{2}|OA|\\cdot|AB|=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tg}x$，",
        "$S_{OACD}=\\frac{1}{2}r^2\\cdot x=\\frac{1}{2}x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由图 3 看出，",
        "$S_{OAD}<S_{OACD}<S_{OAB}$，",
        "或",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x<\\frac{1}{2}x<\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tg}x$，",
        "就是",
        "$\\sin x<x<\\operatorname{tg}x$.　(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为当 $0<x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 时，$\\sin x$ 和 $\\operatorname{tg}x$ 都是正的，所以当 $0<x↵<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 时，不等式(1)成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "剩下的问题是讨论 $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}<x<0$ 的情形. 当 $x$ 取这些值",
        "时，得 $0<-x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，并且对于 $-x$ 可以利用不等式(2)：",
        "$\\sin(-x)<-x<\\operatorname{tg}(-x)$.　(3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为现在 $-x=|x|$，$\\sin(-x)=|\\sin x|$，$\\operatorname{tg}(-x)=|\\operatorname{tg}x|$，",
        "那么由(3)可以得出(1)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样，对于区间 $]-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}[$ 里所有 $x\\ne0$ 的值，完全证明",
        "了不等式(1)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 1　在整个数轴上，余弦函数是连续的，也就是对于",
        "任意 $x_0\\in R$，",
        "$\\lim_{x\\to x_0}\\cos x=\\cos x_0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
